  m_text: "This powerful system delivers dynamic rain/wetness coverage for all movable
    and static gameobjects. Including characters, vehicles, items, and more. Whether
    they\u2019re outdoors, sheltered, or within buildings the effect will dynamically
    cover it with rain/wetness. The effect works seamlessly in both edit and runtime
    mode, greatly enhancing immersion when creating and setting up your scenes."
